  options: ["Stop irrigating, let the canal bleed, flush gently with saline, give local anaesthetic, analgesia and cold compresses, then review","Incise the swelling at once to release the hypochlorite","Neutralise the hypochlorite by irrigating with an acid solution","Obturate the canal immediately to seal the apex"],
