  options: ["Replant, splint flexibly for 2 weeks, give amoxicillin, check tetanus status and monitor for revascularisation","Replant, splint flexibly for 2 weeks and start root canal treatment within 2 weeks","Do not replant, because the tooth has been out of the mouth for more than 30 minutes","Replant and apply a rigid splint for 4 weeks to protect the immature root"],
